<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sukoon Masjid</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;
}

body{
height:100vh;
background:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,20,40,.65),rgba(0,20,40,.65)),
url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564769625905-50e93615e769?q=80&w=1600');
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
color:#fff;
overflow:hidden;
}

.dashboard{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
padding:20px;
gap:15px;
}

/* HEADER */

.header{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr 1fr;
gap:15px;
}

.card{
background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);
backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
border-radius:20px;
padding:15px;
}

.clock{
text-align:center;
}

.time{
font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,90px);
font-weight:bold;
}

.date{
font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,24px);
margin-top:10px;
}

.mosque{
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
}

.mosque h1{
font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,48px);
}

.mosque p{
opacity:.8;
margin-top:8px;
}

.next{
text-align:center;
}

.next-title{
font-size:22px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.next-prayer{
font-size:55px;
font-weight:bold;
color:#ffd54f;
}

.countdown{
font-size:60px;
font-weight:bold;
margin-top:10px;
}

/* PRAYERS */

.prayers{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
gap:15px;
flex:1;
}

.prayer{
background:rgba(0,0,0,.40);
border-radius:25px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
padding:20px;
}

.prayer.active{
background:#16a34a;
}

.prayer-name{
font-size:clamp(24px,2vw,40px);
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.prayer-time{
font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,70px);
font-weight:bold;
}

/* VERSE */

.verse{
background:#f7f1df;
color:#111;
border-radius:20px;
padding:20px;
text-align:center;
}

.verse-title{
font-size:20px;
margin-bottom:15px;
color:#0c4a6e;
}

.verse-text{
font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,42px);
line-height:2;
}

/* HADITH */

.hadith{
background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);
border-radius:20px;
padding:15px;
text-align:center;
font-size:clamp(18px,1.8vw,30px);
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="dashboard">

<div class="header">

<div class="card clock">
<div class="time">20:37</div>
<div class="date">الخميس 24 شتنبر 2026</div>
<div class="date">13 ربيع الآخر 1448 هـ</div>
</div>

<div class="card mosque">
<h1>مسجد مولاي بوعرفة</h1>
<p>الناظور - المغرب</p>
</div>

<div class="card next">
<div class="next-title">الصلاة القادمة</div>
<div class="next-prayer">العشاء</div>
<div class="countdown">00:47:09</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="prayers">

<div class="prayer">
<div class="prayer-name">الفجر</div>
<div class="prayer-time">04:31</div>
</div>

<div class="prayer">
<div class="prayer-name">الظهر</div>
<div class="prayer-time">12:09</div>
</div>

<div class="prayer">
<div class="prayer-name">العصر</div>
<div class="prayer-time">15:31</div>
</div>

<div class="prayer">
<div class="prayer-name">المغرب</div>
<div class="prayer-time">18:11</div>
</div>

<div class="prayer active">
<div class="prayer-name">العشاء</div>
<div class="prayer-time">19:25</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="verse">
<div class="verse-title">آية قرآنية</div>

<div class="verse-text">
﴿ فَاذْكُرُونِي أَذْكُرْكُمْ وَاشْكُرُوا لِي وَلَا تَكْفُرُونِ ﴾
</div>

</div>

<div class="hadith">
قال رسول الله ﷺ : « من دل على خير فله مثل أجر فاعله »
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
